{
  "_comment": "Table column-width profiles for the ELSPETH PDF pipelines (arch-pack and control-pack). Each profile matches a table by exact column count + header-cell prefix or substring match, and applies hand-tuned widths summing to 1.0 for A4 layout. Add a profile only when Pandoc's auto-sizing produces a table that demonstrably reads poorly in the rendered PDF. Matchers name at least two header cells so a profile cannot capture an unrelated table of the same width.",
